  description: "If you control no cards (Quick Effect): You can discard this card;
    apply these effects this turn.\r\n\u25CF Each time your opponent Special Summons
    a monster(s) from any GY(s) or banishment, immediately draw 1 card.\r\n\u25CF
    Once, during this End Phase, if the number of cards in your hand is more than
    the number of cards your opponent controls +6, you must randomly shuffle cards
    from your hand into the Deck so the number in your hand equals the number your
    opponent controls +6.\r\nYou can only activate 1 other \"Mulcharmy\" monster
    effect, the turn you activate this effect."
